  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_3266.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">El Club B&agrave;squet Onda ha presentado la noche de este s&aacute;bado sus equipos en el pabell&oacute;n municipal, en una jornada solidaria con la ONG Quisqueya, en la que se ha jugado el partido Cenemar.es Onda 92-67 CB Altura.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3220.jpg\" alt=\"img_3220\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3222.jpg\" alt=\"img_3222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3225.jpg\" alt=\"img_3225\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3226.jpg\" alt=\"img_3226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3227.jpg\" alt=\"img_3227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3228.jpg\" alt=\"img_3228\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3229.jpg\" alt=\"img_3229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequipsclubbasquetonda/img_3232.jpg\" alt=\"img_3232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenequip